; Forward Email hosted forwarding for pea3nut.org (free plan).
; Review/reference fragment, not a complete zone file. Copy records individually
; into GoDaddy; retain the existing nameservers and all website DNS records.
; Do not publish alongside the old root MX pointing to mail.pea3nut.org.
$ORIGIN pea3nut.org.
$TTL 1800

@ IN MX 0 mx1.forwardemail.net.
@ IN MX 0 mx2.forwardemail.net.

; Catch-all: every local part at pea3nut.org forwards to this Gmail inbox.
; Reviewable plaintext. At cutover, replace this entire TXT value with the
; equivalent encrypted value from https://forwardemail.net/en/encrypt .
; Publish one forwarding rule, not both the plaintext and encrypted versions.
@ IN TXT "forward-email=qq626954412@gmail.com"

; If root SPF already exists, merge include:spf.forwardemail.net into it.
; Never add a second v=spf1 record. Preserve other authorized senders.
@ IN TXT "v=spf1 a include:spf.forwardemail.net -all"
